{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>נקם ברית.</b> There is vengeance that is not in the covenant, like other acts of vengeance — and this is the blinding of Zedekiah's eyes (Sifra). Another interpretation: <b>נקם ברית</b> — the vengeance of My covenant that you transgressed. Every bringing of the sword in Scripture is a war of enemy troops." "<b>ונאספתם.</b> From the outside into the cities, because of the siege (ibid.)." "<b>ושלחתי דבר בתוככם.</b> Through the plague. <b>ונתתם ביד</b> the enemies besieging you — because they do not keep the dead overnight in Jerusalem, and when they bring the dead out to its grave, they are delivered into the hand of the enemy (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:43.223515970Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}